<h2 class="year-title anchored" id="y-2026">2026</h2>
<div>
<div class="pub-card" data-key="Shipkova2026" data-keywords="Emotional Experience||Social Processes||Adolescent Development||Neuroimaging">
<div class="pub-title">
<a href="https://doi.org/10.1111/jora.70154" target="_blank" rel="noopener">The roles of emotional responding and regulation in adolescent friendship stability: A multimethod functional magnetic resonance imaging study</a>
</div>
<div class="pub-meta">
Shipkova, Bonar, Capella, Feldman, Field, Prinstein, Telzer & Lindquist
<br/>
<em>Journal of Research on Adolescence</em>
</div>
<div class="pub-actions">
<a href="#" data-action="abstract" role="button">Abstract</a>
<a href="#" data-action="citation" role="button">Citation</a>
</div>
<div class="toggle-area" data-current="">
